                                        <td style="padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;word-break: break-word">Through this course, I gained new knowledge and improved my understanding of the subject. I hope to apply what I have learned in the future. Overall, it was a valuable learning experience, and I appreciate the lecturer’s effort in guiding us throughout the course, I  really appreciate</td>
